pub const LATE_QUORUM_COMMIT_IDS_METADATA_KEY: &str = "oracle_reward_late_quorum_commit_ids";

/// Block-metadata key holding this block's typed attester settlement records as
/// a JSON array (ADR-003 Phase A, #2846).
///
/// This is the channel through which the P2P applier and WAL replay receive the
/// SAME records the producer applied, rather than recomputing a split from
/// local timing they cannot reconstruct. It is the attester-side twin of
/// `reward_entries`, and the key is ABSENT — not an empty array — on a block
/// that settles nothing, so an attestation-free block's metadata is byte-
/// identical to what it was before ADR-003.
